{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/9b358b767ac49451319db9ceedb8ce0c.avif?t=1760572630\" width=400 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, you are thrust into the heart of a counter-offensive against humanity's foes, leading daring missions deep into enemy territory. Fight in space and on the ground as you spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for our Marine landing forces.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on the planet to safeguard the area against relentless waves of enemies.\u00a0 Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.\u00a0 The enemy will get the message.\u00a0 Create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.\u00a0 After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can get resupplied with unlimited materials to continue building in a<strong> sandbox mode</strong>.\u00a0 Keep coming back to the planet to work on the base and fight off enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien space stations, and escort ships during fleet battles.\u00a0 Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.\u00a0 Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax and Enjoy Down Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.\u00a0 Take a break from the battlefield to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.\u00a0 Gather materials through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.\u00a0 You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?\u00a0 Fly to Earth and explore the civic and cultural institutions in humanity's capital.\u00a0 Don't forget to visit the Library of Earth to read about the Interplanetary War and other interesting topics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76d038162113e0639d8efc3347338dd8.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76d038162113e0639d8efc3347338dd8.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76d038162113e0639d8efc3347338dd8.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3c52e592e6cdbe81e65f043e2e835521.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3c52e592e6cdbe81e65f043e2e835521.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3c52e592e6cdbe81e65f043e2e835521.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightsail Game Studios</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks To:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Richard Wei, MVP (Most Valuable Playtester)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819710?t=1760572630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/0210ad226f900c40f6888a78890a8c506ca1627f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760572630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760572630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760572630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3887930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Current Development Status</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fortified Space Demo is now available! Thank you for the phenomenal level of interest and feedback you have provided so far.\u00a0 The demo will continue to receive regular updates, driven by player suggestions, and the full Early Access version will be released in late 2025.\u00a0 I am currently pivoting toward graphical updates, but I still have a multi-page list of cool features to add and I will be incorporating those over the coming months as well.\u00a0 I hope this game scratches an itch of yours.\u00a0 If so, feel free to wishlist!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/9b358b767ac49451319db9ceedb8ce0c.avif?t=1760572630\" width=400 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, you are thrust into the heart of a counter-offensive against humanity's foes, leading daring missions deep into enemy territory. Fight in space and on the ground as you spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for our Marine landing forces.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on the planet to safeguard the area against relentless waves of enemies.\u00a0 Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.\u00a0 The enemy will get the message.\u00a0 Create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.\u00a0 After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can get resupplied with unlimited materials to continue building in a<strong> sandbox mode</strong>.\u00a0 Keep coming back to the planet to work on the base and fight off enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien space stations, and escort ships during fleet battles.\u00a0 Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.\u00a0 Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/46baac06a5d6dc20384fe2ea29b74207.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax and Enjoy Down Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.\u00a0 Take a break from the battlefield to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.\u00a0 Gather materials through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.\u00a0 You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.poster.avif?t=1760572630\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.webm?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.mp4?t=1760572630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39